      "start": 53,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L5",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:12:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Reported that the radiators are cold and the heating controller is unresponsive. Hot water is still available. Asked for a repair appointment and said she was at home this morning.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 295
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L1",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Update",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L2",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L3",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **To:** Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L5",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "Acknowledged the report and asked about the boiler display, any smell of gas or visible leak, and suitable access arrangements.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 242
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L1",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:39:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **Channel:** SMS",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L2",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:39:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **From:** Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "start": 19,
      "end": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:39:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 50,
      "end": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 08:39:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "Said there was no gas smell or visible leak and the boiler display was blank. She has a mobility impairment and cannot use the stairs quickly. Asked that an attendee call from outside rather than arrive unannounced.",
      "start": 112,
      "end": 327
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 111
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Leah said her adult niece, Erin Vale, sometimes stays overnight but is not authorised to approve work or provide access in her absence. Leah asked that medical details not be shared with contractors; she agreed the agency could say she needs extra time to answer the door.",
      "start": 113,
      "end": 385
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 154
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Sent the reported symptoms and asked for the earliest diagnostic appointment, including whether a same-day visit was available. Noted that access must be arranged directly with Leah.",
      "start": 156,
      "end": 338
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 93
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 94,
      "end": 154
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 09:41:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Offered the next standard appointment on 17 January, 10:00–14:00. The diagnostic call-out is a fixed £168 including VAT; replacement parts or remedial work are not included and would be quoted separately.",
      "start": 156,
      "end": 360
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Reviewed the property authority record: the £250 limit is per urgent repair incident, inclusive of diagnostic call-out, labour and parts, and Maya may authorise qualifying urgent-repair expenditure up to that total without further landlord consent. Temporary heaters, transport and accommodation are not covered by this repair authority.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 482
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **Channel:** SMS",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **From:** Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "start": 19,
      "end": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 50,
      "end": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:18:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "Reported a living-room temperature of 12°C at 10:10. She has one small plug-in heater whose casing becomes unusually hot and has stopped using it. She may be able to stay with her niece tonight if transport can be arranged, but has not confirmed whether the home is accessible.",
      "start": 112,
      "end": 389
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 10:37:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Reported the heating failure, the tenant's temperature reading and the 17 January appointment offer. Asked about a faster diagnostic visit and possible interim arrangements.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 288
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:06:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:06:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:06:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:06:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Said to obtain a quote before committing to non-emergency expenditure. He was travelling and might not respond promptly. He did not address the diagnostic appointment or temporary arrangements in this message.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 325
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 154
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:22:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asked about an earlier slot, a cancellation list and phone triage, and whether the contractor could offer safe temporary-heating advice without a visit.",
      "start": 156,
      "end": 308
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L2",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 93
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L3",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 94,
      "end": 154
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L5",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 11:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Daniel Hart (Heating Contractor, Brackenridge Heat Services)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Confirmed no same-day engineer was available. A cancellation slot might arise on 15 January but could not be reserved without a booking. Brackenridge Heat Services could not assess the property or advise on a substitute heater remotely, and advised that the heater Leah described should not be used.",
      "start": 156,
      "end": 455
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L1",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **Channel:** SMS",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L2",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **From:** Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "start": 19,
      "end": 49
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L3",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 50,
      "end": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:14:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "channel": "SMS",
      "text": "Confirmed she would not use the suspect heater. She can admit a contractor on 15 January if given at least 30 minutes' notice and a direct call. She cannot guarantee access on 17 January because of a hospital appointment. No key is held by the agency.",
      "start": 112,
      "end": 363
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:47:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:47:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:47:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 12:47:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Owen Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Clarified that his request for a quote before committing expenditure concerned non-emergency spending and did not withdraw the standing £250 urgent-repair authority. If the incident is treated as an urgent repair, Maya may authorise the £168 diagnostic call-out without further consent; any later work must remain within the incident limit or be referred for consent.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 483
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Leah Venn (Tenant)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 111
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 13:16:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Discussed possible interim arrangements. Leah said she has no suitable spare heater and is concerned about carrying one because of her mobility impairment. She asked whether delivery of a heater or transport to her niece's home could be arranged. She still needed to check whether the niece's entrance was step-free.",
      "start": 113,
      "end": 429
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 14:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 14:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L3",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 14:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Priya Noll (Duty Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L5",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 14:03:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Escalated the cold-weather report, access requirements, late standard appointment and available £250 urgent-repair authority. Asked what cover or separate spending authority applied to temporary heating, transport or accommodation.",
      "start": 143,
      "end": 374
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L1",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 15:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Priya Noll (Duty Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Update",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L2",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 15:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Priya Noll (Duty Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **From:** Priya Noll (Duty Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 81
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L3",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 15:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Priya Noll (Duty Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 142
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L5",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-14 15:11:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Priya Noll (Duty Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "Confirmed the office could contact the landlord again and check approved suppliers for heater delivery. The duty file records no separate spending limit for temporary equipment, transport or accommodation.",
      "start": 144,
      "end": 349
    },
    {
